Description: OmniPlay Gaming Runtime and Remote Play Client
 OmniPlay is an open, sandboxed emulation runtime and low-latency Remote Play
 streaming platform developed by the Vlikeon project. It features integrated
 hardware presentation, discrete process sandboxing, and unified cloud sync.
